              "manufacturer": "TDK",
              "model": "B32522C0106K000",
              "package": "Radial boxed 18×9×17.5 mm; pitch 15 mm",
              "conditions": "10µF±10%，63VDC/40VAC，额定电压上升率30V/µs；原厂该型号页未列RMS纹波、ESR或ESL。",
